Package: nvssread
Title: Read, Clean, and Tabulate NVSS Mortality Microdata Files
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Eugenio",
    family = "Paglino",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "eugeniopaglino@gmail.com",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8733-6460")
  )
Description: Flexibly reads fixed-width National Vital Statistics System (NVSS)
    mortality files (1989 onwards), harmonizes demographic, geographic
    (including optional longitudinal county FIPS crosswalks), and cause-of-death
    (ICD-9 and ICD-10) variables, optionally performs sequential proportional
    redistribution of missing values with hierarchical fallback, and exports
    annual tabulated CSV files.
